6,"Yekora Language (YKR) - L1 & L2 Speakers, Status, Map ... - Ethnologue",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/ykr/,Yekora is a stable indigenous language of Papua New Guinea. It belongs to the Trans-New Guinea language family. The language is used as a first language by all in the ethnic community. It is not known to be taught in schools.,Yekora,Trans-New Guinea
